<title>UK: Merita Bank sets 1.0 bln Finnish Markka 3-yr FRN.</title>
<headline>Merita Bank sets 1.0 bln Finnish Markka 3-yr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Bank, UBS and Merita Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERITA BANK LTD</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FIM   BASE     3M-HELIBOR  MATURITY	 NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     12.50 BP  PAY DATE    01.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.872    FULL FEES   10.0 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB+	REOFFER    =</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/FI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FINLAND   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
